{"version":1,"content":"<p>由日本男星神木隆之介與女星濱邊美波合演奧斯卡得獎電影《哥斯拉-1.0》續集《哥斯拉-0.0》，昨日（3日）在日本開畫。</p><p>新加盟演出的影后長澤正美，聯同兩位主角及一眾拍檔現身當地戲院見觀眾。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;長澤首次與</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:24:55.712573+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T03:02:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:18:23.416331+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:18:23.416331+00:00","content_hash":"6a17c2383ba9aa9573340f4edb736610a56336f0284875f31683cac0c5796a32","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}